{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/directoryapi\/delete()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/DirectoryApi\/delete()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DELETE \/api\/v1\/tenants\/{tenant_id}\/directory"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK12DirectoryApiV6deleteyyYaKF","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","title":"delete()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"delete","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"delete"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Deleting stops the directory, and only that"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (§30.3 rule 5): directory accounts can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no longer sign in with a password – there is no fallback to a local hash – and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sync stops. Sessions, refresh tokens and passkeys those accounts already hold keep","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"working until they expire or the accounts are deactivated. There is no unlink: a linked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account stays a directory account.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy"